OL,3,GNEWSAKirstie Allsopp airlifted to
OL,4,Ahospital after fall during birthday
OL,5,Acelebrations
OL,6,
OL,7,FTV presenter Kirstie Allsopp has
OL,8,Frevealed she was airlifted to hospital
OL,9,Ffor surgery after slipping and injuring
OL,10,Fher leg while walking home from a beach
OL,11,Fin Devon on holiday.
OL,13,FThe Location, Location, Location host,
OL,14,F55, shared a photo on Instagram of her
OL,15,Flying in an ambulance with cuts on her
OL,16,Fface and a breathing tube up her nose.
OL,18,FShe explained in the adjoining caption
OL,19,Fhow she had "slipped on a muddy patch
OL,20,Fon the steep path", while walking back
OL,21,Fwith her family following her birthday
OL,22,Fcelebrations.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
