OL,3,GNEWSAKirstie Allsopp airlifted to
OL,4,Ahospital after fall during birthday
OL,5,Acelebrations
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We have a picnic on the beach at
OL,8,FWelcombe Mouth, a swim and a walk back
OL,9,Fto the house for some cake," she wrote
OL,10,Fof the longstanding family tradition.
